caption: Accepting Missions

Now that you know how missions are ranked, how do you go about getting one? Easy, talk to your Mission Handler! Now that you are registered, you should have already been introduced, but if you don’t know who they are, please ask any Starbucks employee: they can point you in the right direction! There should be a mission board on your personal device, and accessible through the terminal in the dining area. To accept a mission, create or disband a party, or apply for a rank-up test, just navigate the menus and hit the right button!
